{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\CromQR\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-missing",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/LibraryService.php:138 OCP\\Util::generateRandomBytes(): Nextcloud 13 is the last major to have it, the app declares up to 34; Use \\OC::$server->getSecureRandom()->getMediumStrengthGenerator()->generate($length); instead",
        "lib/Service/LibraryService.php:157 OCP\\Util::generateRandomBytes(): Nextcloud 13 is the last major to have it, the app declares up to 34; Use \\OC::$server->getSecureRandom()->getMediumStrengthGenerator()->generate($length); instead"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses in 1 file of the public API that a major of Nextcloud 32 to 34 no longer has. The app fails there where it comes to that line, or the server no longer calls the method it overrides.",
        "  lib/Service/LibraryService.php:138 OCP\\Util::generateRandomBytes(): Nextcloud 13 is the last major to have it, the app declares up to 34; Use \\OC::$server->getSecureRandom()->getMediumStrengthGenerator()->generate($length); instead",
        "  lib/Service/LibraryService.php:157 OCP\\Util::generateRandomBytes(): Nextcloud 13 is the last major to have it, the app declares up to 34; Use \\OC::$server->getSecureRandom()->getMediumStrengthGenerator()->generate($length); instead"
      ]
    },
    {
